  <meta name="apple-itunes-app" content="app-id=375380948, app-argument=https://apps.apple.com/eg/app/yalla-group-voice-chat-rooms/id1091902866" id="ember196222235" class="ember-view">

  <script name="schema:software-application" id="ember196222237" class="ember-view" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms","description":"Yalla is the most popular Live Group Voice Talking and Entertaining Community. Voice Chat and play games with people from nearby or all over the world.\n\nMeet new friends is never easier:\nChoose group voice rooms from THOUSANDS live rooms daily, filter rooms by Countries or Topics. 50+ Countries has already been covered, while tons of topics are available to choose.\n\nParty with friends with no distances:\nGroup voice talk with friends no matter where they are, broadcast your favorite musics inside the room, sing karaokes together, and play a range of games directly in group chat. Let's get the party started.\n\nFEATURES:\n\nTOTALLY FREE — Enjoy free live voice chat over 3G, 4G, LTE or Wi-Fi.\n\nPUBLIC CHAT ROOMS — Browse THOUSANDS live chat rooms from NEARBY or AROUND THE WORLD that cover thousands of topics. \n\nPRIVATE CONVERSATIONS — Start private one-on-one text and voice conversations with your friends from anywhere in the world.\n\nCHAT GAMES — Play games together directly in your chat group!\n\nVIRTUAL GIFTS — Stunning animated gifts can be sent out to express your love.\n\nSHARE and FOLLOW — Share your favorite ROOMS on Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, Snapchat and more, inviting friends and new followers.\n\nFollow us to get the latest news, updates and events:\nFacebook: facebook.com/yalla2016/\nWebsite: www.yalla.live\n\nDear YALLA users, your feedback and suggestions are welcomed to: yallasupport@yalla.live","screenshot":["https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/ea/78/19/ea78198b-1965-1154-f46b-6bfe3395fe31/mzl.pzeslqiw.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple123/v4/e2/b3/08/e2b3085f-e981-324b-4b2c-9a4abf3511e5/mzl.djgobldx.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/39/0f/9d/390f9d7f-d563-9719-9a7b-ecedcfdf68b7/pr_source.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/05/2c/85/052c8529-0d9e-b1aa-6586-d1550915457f/mzl.fyiqzxlb.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/8f/7c/2a/8f7c2a9e-95c8-b6e2-525a-d5bc6ed847fc/mzl.ylhhfmzc.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple123/v4/02/23/c5/0223c509-1ab3-89d5-4c79-8d34844ce207/mzl.qbssbtsy.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/af/ab/51/afab51b2-9761-4d0e-5833-b58a9ae7461d/mzl.ewzhpkpa.png/300x0w.jpg"],"image":"https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple123/v4/b4/0d/29/b40d2988-d767-338e-a3dc-473ef71fe0be/AppIcon-Yalla-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-0-85-220.png/1200x630wa.png","applicationCategory":"Entertainment","datePublished":"18 Apr 2016","operatingSystem":"Requires iOS 9.0 or later. Compatible with iPhone, iPad and iPod touch.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC","url":"https://apps.apple.com/eg/developer/yalla-technology-fz-llc/id1444567250"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.3,"reviewCount":228},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":0,"priceCurrency":"EGP","category":"free"}}
</script>
